cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or the released WHO 2021 label file, please cite the
  archived software release below and the associated article.
type: software
title: >-
  Glioma-Classification v3.0.0: analysis code and WHO 2021 label release for
  "Diagnostic label–IDH discordance and machine-learning classifier performance
  on a legacy TCGA glioma grading benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Analysis notebook, source script, locked decisions, result tables and
  figures for an audit of the UCI/TCGA Glioma Grading benchmark (UCI dataset
  759). Four model families are compared by nested cross-validation with all
  decisions locked before a held-out test set is scored; errors are related
  to agreement between the legacy LGG/GBM label and IDH status; and approximate
  WHO 2021 categories are reconstructed by linking TCGA case identifiers to
  published molecular annotations (cBioPortal lgggbm_tcga_pub). Includes a
  versioned patient-level label file with a datasheet. Research use only;
  not for clinical diagnosis.
